/cover/671dcf2cd1d9802c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>o1 不是路线转弯，是 AGI 梯子又多了几节</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">预训练这座金矿快挖到头了，强化学习是第二座矿。o1 的 preview 更像 GPT-3 时刻，能不能成为 ChatGPT 时刻要看正式版。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">o1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"74. 从蒸汽机到无人驾驶4｜Waymo和它的对手们：我暗中考察了四个月 DARPA Grand Challenge AlexNet 端到端 Moon Shot Project Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-11-zhangxiaojun-waymo-领先不是技术最强-是没犯过大错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e35749cd8b4f7e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>Waymo 领先不是技术最强，是没犯过大错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Waymo 起步最早、换过四任负责人、被业内一致看衰，最后却成了 L4 唯一还在引领行业的公司——因为它活了下来，且没犯 Cruise 和 Uber 那种致命错误。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Waymo</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"73. AGI范式大转移：和广密预言草莓、OpenAI o1和self-play RL｜全球大模型季报4 Self-Play RL Scaling Law reward model RLHF MOE DiT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-05-zhangxiaojun-不做强化学习的公司-下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27f4c2e89ae9ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>不做强化学习的公司，下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言预训练遇到瓶颈后，硅谷最核心的几百名研究者已把资源压注到 self-play RL 上，它用推理算力换训练算力，让模型自己探索出逻辑推理能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"72. 从蒸汽机到无人驾驶3｜和孟醒聊特斯拉FSD进化史 MPI / MPCI BEV + Transformer VLM Remote Assist garbage in garbage out\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-02-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉fsd只是辅助驾驶的gpt-3时刻-不是l4/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlUGppFTCiD6i4x1NEFWXtpkFo2M.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉FSD只是辅助驾驶的GPT-3时刻，不是L4</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">端到端让FSD一年内连升数版，但45分钟接管一次和Waymo的10万公里一次关键接管差约1000倍。L2要的是最优接管率，不是越低越好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉FSD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"71. 和楼天城聊聊Robotaxi和ACRush：“L2做得越厉害，离L4越远” contest based metric system MPX Hold hard end-to-end BEV Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-08-16-zhangxiaojun-l2做得越好离l4越远-无人驾驶的路线之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d093a1c7aa808aa9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>L2做得越好离L4越远，无人驾驶的路线之争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小马智行楼天城认为 L2 和 L4 目标不同：L2 用户只要够用、成本更低，做得越好反而离 L4 越远；L4 要的是万小时不出事，还得有一把评价好坏的尺子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"70. 和何小鹏聊，FSD、“在血海游泳”、乱世中的英雄与狗熊 AD BOM Robot Taxi OTA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-07-16-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-大模型对小型公司不利-越强越多数据越多费用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/514c23c30b63a46b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0716</span></div>\n<h2>何小鹏：大模型对小型公司不利，越强越多数据越多费用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大 AI 的网络效应是：越强所以越多数据，越多数据所以越多费用，越多费用所以要卖越多车去支持这个体系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"69. 口述全球大模型这半年：Perplexity突然火爆和尚未爆发的AI应用生态 PMF RAG MOE Scaling Law Latency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-23-zhangxiaojun-ai应用没爆发-不是产品问题是模型问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88869a8f5db7fb1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0623</span></div>\n<h2>AI应用没爆发，不是产品问题是模型问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GPT-4 出来一年多，硅谷主流 VC 投出的 AI 应用只有 Perplexity 一家跑到 2000 多万月活；90% 的原因是只基于 GPT-4 的能力不够，只能做信息组合，做不了长距离推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Perplexity</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"68. 和MiniMax天使投资人聊，MiniMax幕后故事和大模型资本扑克牌 Club Deal corner cases MOE scale up L4\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-10-zhangxiaojun-minimax-第一位投资人-大厂降价是看牌-创业公司只能认赔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6400a25bba631a90-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0610</span></div>\n<h2>MiniMax 第一位投资人：大厂降价是看牌，创业公司只能认赔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大厂做模型可以不赚钱、从云计算把钱挣回来，创业公司被拖进价格战却无处回血；MiniMax 的解法是模型质量第一，靠海外 2C 产品收钱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"67. 谈谈黄仁勋搭建的组织系统：分布式操作系统，“就像一台GPU” Conway&#x27;s Law context, not control Zero Billion Dollar Market chiplet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-31-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有五年计划-黄仁勋把公司做成了一台-gpu/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f0eed2af727e6cd8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0531</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达没有五年计划：黄仁勋把公司做成了一台 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋的八条反常识管理法不是散点，而是一套分布式操作系统：60 个高管直接汇报、薪酬精确到一美分相同、不做一对一、不做计划——组织沟通结构决定了产品架构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"66. 和李志飞聊IPO、GPT-4o和你不知道的前沿科技创业的痛 VLA DiT In Context Learning codec P&amp;L\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-23-zhangxiaojun-前沿科技创业的痛-上市那天-我觉得对不起这12年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b6a457f38ae1bd4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>前沿科技创业的痛：上市那天，我觉得对不起这12年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">出门问问创始人李志飞说，敲钟那一刻他想的不是荣耀，而是「今天这个结果对得起我12年受的磨难吗——对不起」。他把前沿科技创业的宿命总结成一块随时会化的浮冰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">前沿科技创业</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"65. 风险投资的钥匙失灵了吗？和梦秋聊：蛰伏、更少人的游戏和啮齿动物 明股实债 check size power law foundation model AI for science AI for coding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-22-zhangxiaojun-vc-的以小博大逻辑失效了-我们改做侏罗纪的老鼠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3a24508c632217d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0422</span></div>\n<h2>VC 的以小博大逻辑失效了，我们改做侏罗纪的老鼠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美元 VC 的募资端和退出端同时被掐断，靠十个 check 里中两三个的杠杆故事讲不下去了。清流资本的选择是：要么投一两年就能变现的现在学，要么投七到十年的未来学，中间地带最难。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"64. 和广密聊AGI大基建时代：电+芯片=产出智能 Scaling Law Agent 主权 AI T5T Killer App\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-17-zhangxiaojun-agi-是马拉松-物理硬件成了最大瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9219795544d999cf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0417</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 是马拉松：物理硬件成了最大瓶颈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">去年以为加 GPU 加数据就能到 AGI，今年发现单数据中心加到 3.2 万卡就撞墙，美国能源基建还是四五十年前规划的——AGI 时间表被物理世界拖长了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"63. 商业口述史：中资到海外买买买的大时代，以430亿美元并购先正达为最高潮 Synergy management retention offtake EV/EBITDA DCF HSE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-07-zhangxiaojun-430亿美元买先正达-中国买买买大时代的高潮与落幕/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FimDPSiKE_QPoV0SwdcF8TQUYo5I.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0407</span></div>\n<h2>430亿美元买先正达：中国买买买大时代的高潮与落幕</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国企业海外并购的黄金期起于2009年官方定调、止于2017年逆全球化，先正达是最高潮也是终点；买得便宜不如买得对路，整合才是成败关键。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">海外并购</span><span class=\"tag\">先正达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"62. 你们要的朱啸虎，来了 PMF Llama POC C2C 视频电话\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-01-zhangxiaojun-朱啸虎-中国-aigc-应用已经大爆发-只是都藏在-to-b-里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4a9e53f96035921e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">52:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0401</span></div>\n<h2>朱啸虎：中国 AIGC 应用已经大爆发，只是都藏在 to B 里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱啸虎说中国 AIGC 应用已经大爆发，只是都发生在企业服务里：外卖意外险赔付率从 150 块降到 60 块，视频面试一年做到 100 万人次，消费者根本看不见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AIGC</span><span cl